### 11.7 Influencer Partnerships

In addition to a brand ambassador program, establishing strategic partnerships with influencers can amplify our reach and credibility. Influencers can serve as authentic voices for our brand, sharing their experiences and insights with their audiences. Our strategy will encompass:

