- **Sponsored Content and Takeovers**: Inviting influencers to create sponsored content or take over our social media accounts for a day can provide fresh perspectives and attract new followers. For instance, allowing an influencer to showcase a “day in the life” using our products can humanize our brand and generate excitement.

